{"seq":1,"slug":"a-towering-man-of-letters","title":"A Towering Man Of Letters","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/a-towering-man-of-letters","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-universal-genius","title":"旷世全才","url":"/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/a-towering-man-of-letters/the-universal-genius","wordCount":1573,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"leader-of-song-letters","title":"宋代文坛领袖","url":"/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/a-towering-man-of-letters/leader-of-song-letters","wordCount":1547,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现苏轼作为旷世全才与文坛领袖的地位。苏轼是中国文化史上罕见的全才——他在诗、词、文、书、画乃至哲学、政治等众多领域都有所建树，且融会贯通、相互辉映。他继欧阳修之后成为北宋文坛领袖，团结、提携了\"苏门四学士\"等一大批文学人才，以崇高的人格与宽广的胸怀引领了一个时代的文风。本章揭示苏轼全面而高超的才华与崇高的文坛地位。\n"}